  "description": "Native UI placement, scroll tracking, and Web projection for Capacitor and Cordova plugin authors.",
  "headline": "Bring Web UI above the native layer",
  "overview": "Coordinate native controls and Web content across scrolling screens, transitions, and overlays on iOS and Android. Integrate the Engine into your plugin while retaining its renderer and public API. The API is pre-1.0.",
  "featuresHeading": "Features",
